title Spike 13: players
about Blue is three players, red is one. Each plays only its own units, in its own shade. Blue's first player runs the economy: its factory makes army for the second. 4 minutes at 8x.

scenario economy
players blue 3
clip 0..7200
speed 8
camera 170,256 260

# Blue.0 is the economy player: what its factory makes goes to blue.1.
at 60 select blue factory as plant
at 61 output plant to 1

# Observed: each player keeps its own base (one factory each); at 7200
# blue.0 has made no army of its own (its factory's 12 raiders and tanks
# went to blue.1, who has 29 units), blue.2 has 22, red 35; blue made 93
# units, red 77.
at 3600 expect blue.0 factories >= 1
at 3600 expect blue.1 factories >= 1
at 3600 expect blue.2 factories >= 1
at 7200 expect blue.0 raiders == 0
at 7200 expect blue.0 tanks == 0
at 7200 expect blue.1 raiders >= 4
at 7200 expect blue.1 units >= 15
at 7200 expect blue.2 units >= 10
at 7200 expect blue spawned >= 60
at 7200 expect red spawned >= 40
